13. Start the Server
At the bottom of index.js:
app.listen(3000, () => {
    console.log('Server is running on port 3000');
});
Run:
node index.js
Or:
npx nodemon index.js
14. Open the Pages
Danish:
http://localhost:3000/danish
Poorvi:
http://localhost:3000/poorvi
Deeksha:
http://localhost:3000/deeksha
