17. Important EJS Concepts

app.set('view engine', 'ejs')
→ Sets EJS as the view engine.
res.render('profile')
→ Renders the profile EJS page.
res.render('profile', data)
→ Renders profile.ejs with data.
<%= value %>
→ Displays a JavaScript value inside EJS/HTML.
18. Remember This Flow

Browser requests /danish
        ↓
Express route
        ↓
res.render('profile', data)
        ↓
profile.ejs
        ↓
<%= firstName %>
        ↓
Danish
        ↓
HTML sent to browser
Key Point
One EJS file + different data = different dynamic pages.




